  <h2>Professional Self-Assessment</h2>

  <h3>Overview</h3>
  <p>
    Throughout the CS499 Capstone course, I have enhanced multiple artifacts that demonstrate growth in software design, algorithms, data structures, and database development. 
    This self-assessment reflects on the skills I have strengthened, challenges I have overcome, and the professional competencies I am prepared to apply in a real-world environment. 
